      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "土地全体が作物を枯らす病に侵され、うち捨てられた\nメグレズの集落跡だが、再び人が住めるように\nなったかどうかを調べたい。集落跡に赴いて、\nそこの砂を持ち帰ってきてくれないか？",
        "official_en": "The Ruins of Megrez are an abandoned town where\nthe crops became diseased and died. I'd like to know\nif the area might be habitable by humans again.\nPlease go to the site and bring back a soil sample?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
