        "branch_option": null,
        "branch_phase": null,
        "authored_group": "MSQID_Comp_SearchingMegrez"
      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "足労だった。砂は早速調査に回した。\n恐らくだが、汚染は消えているだろう。\n実はメグレズは私の故郷なのだ。\nおかげで久しぶりに里帰りができそうだ。",
        "official_en": "Thank you for your help. I'll send the sample off for\ntesting, but I'm almost certain just from the look and\nsmell that the contamination has gone. I was born in\nMegrez. Thanks to you, I can return home soon.",
        "real_en": null
      },
